WEBVTT

01:40.910 --> 01:43.490
<b>To be honest, you surprised me.</b>

01:45.870 --> 01:47.160
<b>Abyss.</b>

01:47.830 --> 01:53.710
<b>I thought Rayne was the only student
capable of facing his Evil Eye.</b>

01:54.710 --> 01:59.890
<b>You can't possibly be a better magic user
than Rayne, a Divine Visionary.</b>

02:00.260 --> 02:02.050
<b>But could it be that...</b>

02:02.180 --> 02:03.060
<b>GASP</b>

02:03.060 --> 02:04.180
<b>CLAMP</b>

02:05.140 --> 02:07.100
<b>What's wrong, so suddenly?</b>

02:07.100 --> 02:11.520
<b>No! It's nothing. Please, go on.</b>

02:12.110 --> 02:15.320
<b>In any case, you seem quite capable.</b>

02:16.110 --> 02:17.820
<b>PHEW</b>

02:18.110 --> 02:23.330
<b>Which is why someone superior
like you should understand...</b>

02:24.990 --> 02:29.000
<b>that this world does not treat
everyone equally.</b>

02:30.710 --> 02:34.960
<b>I mentioned our beastly natures
to you once before.</b>

02:35.840 --> 02:39.970
<b>I can't abide by inferior genes.</b>

02:40.300 --> 02:44.810
<b>They're on the receiving end,
yet they take advantage of our kindness.</b>

02:44.810 --> 02:47.470
<b>And they selfishly assert their rights.</b>

02:48.020 --> 02:50.640
<b>Audacious, is it not?</b>

02:51.480 --> 02:55.440
<b>We don't need to burden ourselves
with useless luggage.</b>

02:56.980 --> 03:01.610
<b>Um, that means
people who can't use magic...</b>

03:02.110 --> 03:04.120
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

03:04.280 --> 03:05.740
<b>We must dispose of them.</b>

03:05.740 --> 03:07.490
<b>SHOCK</b>

03:07.700 --> 03:11.370
<b>Merely segregating them
from society is too kind.</b>

03:11.620 --> 03:13.960
<b>I will change that system.</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:20.220
<b>This includes other underachievers
and people who shelter the weak.</b>

03:21.380 --> 03:23.140
<b>Those sheltering...</b>

03:26.220 --> 03:27.260
<b>Mash.</b>

03:27.680 --> 03:31.270
<b>You really are a good, honest boy.</b>

03:33.600 --> 03:37.360
<b>What? A double back somersault
at this age!?</b>

03:38.070 --> 03:40.530
<b>Here, have my cream puff and...</b>

03:41.240 --> 03:43.410
<b>He's eating it before I told him to!</b>

03:46.620 --> 03:51.160
<b>Mash, I'm so proud of you, my son.</b>

03:53.040 --> 03:55.920
<b>Okay, I understand.</b>

03:58.130 --> 04:03.680
<b>Your way is kind of a problem for me.
So I don't think we can be friends.</b>

04:04.340 --> 04:07.760
<b>I see. So you cannot understand.</b>

04:08.350 --> 04:11.600
<b>It seems you're a little dense.</b>

04:12.600 --> 04:16.690
<b>And inferior genes must be eradicated.</b>

04:23.860 --> 04:26.820
<b>Phew, I sure worked hard today.</b>

04:27.450 --> 04:29.830
<b>Huh? It's kinda broken.</b>

04:33.460 --> 04:35.920
<b><i>Lord Abel and Mushroom Head
are fighting each other!</i></b>

04:35.920 --> 04:37.840
<b><i>Talk about bad timing!</i></b>

04:43.010 --> 04:46.510
<b>That doll has acid in it.</b>

04:46.840 --> 04:48.550
<b>You should be careful.</b>

04:49.600 --> 04:50.510
<b>Okay.</b>

04:54.480 --> 04:57.100
<b><i>What exactly is his plan
under these circumstances?</i></b>

05:08.070 --> 05:08.820
<b><i>Huh-wha?</i></b>

05:10.240 --> 05:11.620
<b><i>Huh-wha-wha?</i></b>

05:13.370 --> 05:15.870
<b><i>He took them out with one throw
without touching the acidic dolls.</i></b>

05:15.870 --> 05:17.750
<b>STRIKE</b>

05:17.880 --> 05:20.750
<b><i>Like a bunch of bowling pins!</i></b>

05:21.750 --> 05:26.470
<b>So you mentioned something
about inferior genes earlier.</b>

05:27.590 --> 05:34.060
<b>But if I beat you,
does that mean you have inferior genes?</b>

05:34.930 --> 05:37.850
<b>You don't know when to keep quiet.</b>

05:38.100 --> 05:41.440
<b>Also, what did you do with Lemon?</b>

05:41.730 --> 05:45.990
<b>Lemon? I have no idea
who you're talking about.</b>

05:46.150 --> 05:49.530
<b>All I'm doing is receiving
magical power from everyone.</b>

05:50.070 --> 05:54.410
<b>All you're doing?
But everyone is getting sick because of it.</b>

05:55.080 --> 05:59.920
<b>I told you.
The strong take from the weak.</b>

06:00.380 --> 06:02.290
<b>That's our right.</b>

06:04.050 --> 06:07.170
<b>You can't even stop them.</b>

06:07.550 --> 06:11.180
<b>But that shows your current skill level.</b>

06:11.350 --> 06:12.430
<b><i>It's over!</i></b>

06:17.560 --> 06:20.940
<b><i>He has grown since last we met.</i></b>

06:22.230 --> 06:27.150
<b>The strong take from the weak,
and that's their right, yes?</b>

06:28.110 --> 06:29.280
<b>Then,</b>

06:30.570 --> 06:34.240
<b>when I win,
you'll tell me where Lemon is.</b>

06:36.540 --> 06:38.750
<b>I think I should move back home.</b>

06:40.460 --> 06:42.750
<b>You're not just talk, I see.</b>

06:44.300 --> 06:45.630
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:45.630 --> 06:49.220
<b>And that's all I have to say about that.</b>

07:08.820 --> 07:10.110
<b>What was that?</b>

07:10.740 --> 07:12.110
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:12.320 --> 07:16.490
<b>That was just too one-sided.
It lacks class.</b>

07:19.460 --> 07:20.660
<b>Finn.</b>

07:21.330 --> 07:23.250
<b>This is your friend, right?</b>

07:23.630 --> 07:26.800
<b>I captured him, thinking
he'd make good entertainment.</b>

07:27.340 --> 07:32.050
<b>Your spiky-haired friend
was too badly injured to be useful.</b>

07:33.140 --> 07:36.600
<b>I'm looking forward to an interesting show.</b>

07:42.020 --> 07:44.860
<b>Did I say you could lift a hand against him?</b>

07:45.610 --> 07:48.940
<b>I'm sorry, but you're not allowed to attack.</b>

07:49.690 --> 07:54.450
<b>If you break the rules,
I will break your friend apart.</b>

07:56.200 --> 08:01.750
<b>I see, so that's the way you play.</b>

08:04.250 --> 08:08.590
<b>You can break your friend apart
if you'd like.</b>

08:09.510 --> 08:13.010
<b>If you don't,
you'll be the one who breaks.</b>

08:14.340 --> 08:18.140
<b>You can't do that?
You can't choose to sacrifice?</b>

08:18.680 --> 08:22.520
<b>Humans always want to believe
they are good.</b>

08:23.060 --> 08:26.900
<b>But I'm saying that is a lie.</b>

08:31.900 --> 08:33.780
<b><i>It seems the axe broke first.</i></b>

08:35.280 --> 08:36.910
<b>It kind of sounds like...</b>

08:38.200 --> 08:42.080
<b>you think you're a pretty deep person, huh?</b>

08:45.330 --> 08:47.170
<b><i>War is on!</i></b>

08:47.420 --> 08:52.050
<b>Oh, by the way,
you wanted my gold coin, right?</b>

08:53.220 --> 08:55.590
<b>You finally feel like handing it over?</b>

08:56.300 --> 08:58.800
<b>Yes, if you want it that badly.</b>

09:01.850 --> 09:03.480
<b><i>He used the coin on the threads?</i></b>

09:10.940 --> 09:14.860
<b>I'm sorry. I guess this coin just likes me.</b>

09:18.950 --> 09:21.870
<b>I'm sick of you nitpicking on what I say.</b>

09:22.120 --> 09:24.660
<b>I'm sorry I can't keep playing along with it.</b>

09:26.580 --> 09:30.790
<b>It's useless. Human power can't resist it.</b>

09:31.300 --> 09:35.220
<b>In the end, you are nothing more
than another puppet.</b>

09:35.630 --> 09:38.390
<b>What I am doesn't matter.</b>

09:39.390 --> 09:40.890
<b>I need to have you...</b>

09:41.140 --> 09:45.560
<b>regret lashing out at my friends.</b>

10:10.960 --> 10:12.460
<b>Marioness Change!</b>

10:20.430 --> 10:21.970
<b>I am impressed.</b>

10:22.470 --> 10:25.720
<b>You made me cast this spell.</b>

10:26.350 --> 10:30.230
<b>But, it's still survival of the fittest.</b>

10:32.150 --> 10:34.730
<b>The weak are but prey.</b>

10:38.070 --> 10:44.580
<b>In my eyes, you are nothing more
than an unusually clever rabbit.</b>

10:48.830 --> 10:51.250
<b>I will take your coin.</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:54.130
<b>You were good sport for a rabbit.</b>

10:55.050 --> 10:58.340
<b>But in the end, a rabbit is still a rabbit.</b>

10:58.760 --> 11:00.260
<b>You cannot become a wolf...</b>

11:04.470 --> 11:05.970
<b>What is this?</b>

11:09.520 --> 11:10.520
<b>Oh!</b>

11:10.730 --> 11:14.770
<b>Why is my cream puff
that I hid in my robe pocket here?</b>

11:14.980 --> 11:19.030
<b><i>You don't normally put a cream puff
directly into your robe pocket.</i></b>

11:19.900 --> 11:21.700
<b><i>But how could he...</i></b>

11:21.950 --> 11:26.040
<b><i>He was fully transformed into a puppet.
How did he move on his own?</i></b>

11:27.040 --> 11:31.000
<b><i>My puppet magic blocks
electric signals from the brain</i></b>

11:31.000 --> 11:33.580
<b><i>and wrests away
voluntary physical movement.</i></b>

11:34.460 --> 11:36.210
<b><i>He shouldn't have been able to move.</i></b>

11:37.510 --> 11:38.510
<b><i>Was it...</i></b>

11:39.380 --> 11:41.090
<b><i>a spinal reflex?</i></b>

11:41.300 --> 11:43.800
<b>SPINAL REFLEX</b>

11:41.970 --> 11:43.800
<b><i>Spinal reflex.</i></b>

11:44.430 --> 11:47.140
<b><i>It's when you pull back
after touching something hot,</i></b>

11:47.890 --> 11:51.770
<b><i>or when your foot jolts up when the part
below your kneecap is tapped.</i></b>

11:51.770 --> 11:54.900
<b><i>In order to respond quickly
to external threats,</i></b>

11:55.150 --> 12:01.070
<b><i>your neurotransmitters use a shortcut
that bypasses your brain.</i></b>

12:02.360 --> 12:07.620
<b><i>It's true my magic only transforms
the exterior which I then puppet, but...</i></b>

12:08.410 --> 12:10.830
<b><i>internally, they remain human.</i></b>

12:11.460 --> 12:15.040
<b><i>A spontaneous response in puppet form</i></b>

12:15.170 --> 12:17.710
<b><i>would have to be the result of a spinal reflex.</i></b>

12:18.880 --> 12:19.840
<b><i>In other words...</i></b>

12:19.840 --> 12:22.840
<b>BAM</b>

12:20.670 --> 12:22.840
<b><i>An unconscious defense against a threat.</i></b>

12:23.180 --> 12:26.470
<b>Hanging on to that cream puff
was that important to you!?</b>

12:26.850 --> 12:31.480
<b><i>It seems hanging on to the cream puff
was that important to him.</i></b>

12:34.600 --> 12:41.740
<b>Survival of the fittest demands that
the weak fight to protect themselves as well.</b>

12:42.570 --> 12:45.490
<b>All right. I will acknowledge that.</b>

12:46.120 --> 12:49.620
<b>I can extract magic power from my dolls.</b>

12:49.990 --> 12:53.750
<b>And I can use the magic power
that I extract.</b>

12:54.420 --> 12:58.750
<b>I'll crush you with the ultimate spell.</b>

13:05.260 --> 13:07.140
<b>Marioness Secondth.</b>

13:07.760 --> 13:09.350
<b>Harm Puppet!</b>

13:10.640 --> 13:15.020
<b>Harm Puppet turns anything
within a 100-meter radius into puppets.</b>

13:15.810 --> 13:19.770
<b>Transformation begins
the moment the strings touch you.</b>

13:20.440 --> 13:23.690
<b>Strings you cannot see, of course.</b>

13:24.740 --> 13:26.910
<b><i>That means me too?</i></b>

13:27.160 --> 13:31.910
<b>When the strings descend upon you,
they will rob you of bodily control.</b>

13:31.910 --> 13:33.660
<b>There is no way to counter them.</b>

13:34.460 --> 13:39.840
<b>Once you are a puppet, your body
will be toyed with until you can't recover.</b>

13:42.460 --> 13:45.170
<b>This is my respect for you.</b>

13:46.970 --> 13:50.180
<b>Even against a rabbit,
I must use all that I have.</b>

13:52.310 --> 13:54.060
<b>I had too much pride.</b>

13:55.810 --> 13:58.350
<b>And I thank you for showing me...</b>

14:10.450 --> 14:11.660
<b>Huh?</b>

14:11.660 --> 14:13.580
<b>Am I being appreciated?</b>

14:14.040 --> 14:16.080
<b>How did you stop the transformation?</b>

14:16.500 --> 14:18.080
<b>I tore the strings.</b>

14:18.540 --> 14:19.580
<b><i>He can't have!</i></b>

14:20.210 --> 14:22.880
<b><i>It's impossible to see the strings
as they descend.</i></b>

14:23.210 --> 14:25.300
<b><i>No human can stop them.</i></b>

14:26.340 --> 14:28.180
<b><i>Lemme tell y'all what I saw.</i></b>

14:28.180 --> 14:34.010
<b><i>Right after Lord Abel used his magic,
the dude turned his body in a peculiar way.</i></b>

14:34.180 --> 14:38.480
<b><i>It must have been to delay contact
with the rest of the strings.</i></b>

14:38.480 --> 14:41.980
<b><i>And most likely,
once he felt the strings on his left side...</i></b>

14:42.520 --> 14:45.990
<b><i>before he lost control of his right side,
he snapped the strings!</i></b>

14:46.610 --> 14:50.740
<b><i>A savage and way too instinctive strategy!</i></b>

14:51.370 --> 14:52.660
<b><i>Impossible.</i></b>

14:53.200 --> 14:54.740
<b><i>He's inhuman!</i></b>

14:55.160 --> 14:56.660
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:57.660 --> 15:00.580
<b>You're sweating, Mr. Rabbit.</b>

15:04.090 --> 15:08.010
<b>You really are amusing,
Mash Burnedead!</b>

15:15.470 --> 15:18.730
<b><i>Ah... I'd never considered...</i></b>

15:20.640 --> 15:22.730
<b>Erector Spinae Magic.</b>

15:23.230 --> 15:24.360
<b>Hell Fall!</b>

15:26.820 --> 15:28.860
<b><i>That yours truly could be...</i></b>

15:33.740 --> 15:35.370
<b><i>the rabbit.</i></b>

15:37.950 --> 15:42.080
<b>My mother was very kind
and compassionate towards others.</b>

15:43.080 --> 15:49.510
<b>Though born into nobility,
she treated commoners just as equally.</b>

15:50.760 --> 15:56.680
<b>My mother said it was only by chance
that we were born privileged.</b>

15:58.180 --> 16:02.020
<b>Then one day,
my kind mother was stabbed.</b>

16:03.020 --> 16:08.190
<b>She was distributing food to the poor
as she always did.</b>

16:08.940 --> 16:13.910
<b>A man hoarded all the food for himself,
and stabbed my mother when she resisted.</b>

16:14.950 --> 16:16.490
<b>He said that...</b>

16:16.950 --> 16:22.080
<b>getting stabbed was a comeuppance
for always having it so lucky.</b>

16:23.080 --> 16:26.670
<b>She believed in the goodness of humanity.</b>

16:27.500 --> 16:32.420
<b>My mother, the noble.
My mother, the naïf.</b>

16:34.840 --> 16:38.390
<b>My gentle mother was gone.</b>

16:40.390 --> 16:42.560
<b>Mother was mistaken.</b>

16:43.230 --> 16:45.900
<b>They don't need our pity.</b>

16:47.020 --> 16:50.820
<b>The dregs of society
are there for a reason.</b>

16:51.490 --> 16:53.240
<b>We can't live in harmony.</b>

16:54.530 --> 16:58.200
<b>I sought the best talent for my plan.</b>

16:58.950 --> 17:03.540
<b>Abyss and others like him,
those who are dissatisfied with this world.</b>

17:05.000 --> 17:07.960
<b>I dipped my hand into powers
I never should have.</b>

17:09.170 --> 17:10.880
<b>All for my goals...</b>

17:11.590 --> 17:13.840
<b>You won't change my mind.</b>

17:14.430 --> 17:16.890
<b>It's only natural to pillage weak scum.</b>

17:17.600 --> 17:19.560
<b>No, they deserve to be pillaged.</b>

17:21.100 --> 17:23.810
<b>Bad guys are bad
no matter what their social status is.</b>

17:24.100 --> 17:27.650
<b>The majority of those fools
are at the bottom.</b>

17:27.860 --> 17:31.070
<b>That is why the bottom class
should be cut off altogether.</b>

17:32.280 --> 17:34.240
<b>That would be a problem.</b>

17:36.570 --> 17:38.570
<b>Yeah, a problem. Really.</b>

17:38.570 --> 17:39.990
<b>I heard you the first time.</b>

17:40.740 --> 17:42.040
<b>That aside...</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:46.000
<b>Could you tell me where Lemon is?</b>

17:46.710 --> 17:48.040
<b>Since you lost.</b>

17:51.170 --> 17:52.550
<b>You're right.</b>

17:53.090 --> 17:57.760
<b>I will release the students
who I turned into puppets. I have lost.</b>

17:57.970 --> 17:59.180
<b>Thanks.</b>

17:59.350 --> 18:00.300
<b>Oh.</b>

18:00.300 --> 18:03.890
<b>But since you did this
all for your mom,</b>

18:03.890 --> 18:05.850
<b>I guess you're not that terrible a person.</b>

18:06.690 --> 18:08.730
<b>I'm slightly relieved by that.</b>

18:12.730 --> 18:14.820
<b>Marioness Liberation.</b>

18:25.500 --> 18:27.120
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

18:27.500 --> 18:30.080
<b>I was captured by a puppet.</b>

18:31.250 --> 18:33.630
<b>Mash! Lemon!</b>

18:33.710 --> 18:36.380
<b>I'm glad! You guys were all right!</b>

18:36.550 --> 18:38.880
<b>I'm sorry to make you worry.</b>

18:38.880 --> 18:43.140
<b>I was worried, but I'm glad.
I'm really glad.</b>

18:43.430 --> 18:46.640
<b>Hip, hip, hooray!</b>

18:50.770 --> 18:55.150
<b>They're all such fools,
aren't they, Mother?</b>

18:57.190 --> 19:00.410
<b>Hip, hip, hooray!</b>

19:00.660 --> 19:02.910
<b>Coin, coin, coin, coin, coin, coin.</b>

19:03.160 --> 19:04.910
<b>Hero, hero!</b>

19:05.120 --> 19:06.910
<b>Husband! Husband!</b>

19:07.120 --> 19:09.920
<b>Oh yeah! Oh yeah!</b>

19:11.250 --> 19:12.920
<b>I was so scared!</b>

19:13.420 --> 19:15.920
<b>- Thank you, Mash!
- It's cool.</b>

19:16.510 --> 19:17.800
<b>Mash.</b>

19:19.050 --> 19:23.180
<b>I'm really sorry about this.
It's my fault.</b>

19:23.800 --> 19:26.680
<b>But really, um...</b>

19:30.100 --> 19:34.020
<b>I really, truly thank you very much.</b>

19:34.730 --> 19:37.150
<b>Yeah. I'm glad you're safe.</b>

19:37.740 --> 19:39.570
<b>You cad!</b>

19:39.570 --> 19:40.700
<b>Why?</b>

19:40.700 --> 19:43.070
<b>Me too! I worked hard too!</b>

19:43.200 --> 19:44.740
<b>Oh, Dot.</b>

19:44.740 --> 19:46.040
<b>It's Dot.</b>

19:46.040 --> 19:47.080
<b>Dot.</b>

19:47.160 --> 19:50.080
<b>Hip, hip, hooray!</b>

19:51.000 --> 19:54.080
<b>Truly, they're all fools.</b>

19:54.840 --> 19:57.590
<b>Huh? By the way, where's Lance?</b>

19:59.090 --> 19:59.970
<b>Huh?</b>

20:01.720 --> 20:02.890
<b>Stop.</b>

20:06.470 --> 20:09.600
<b>You don't belong
at this school, do you?</b>

20:10.350 --> 20:12.230
<b>Whatever might you be suggest...</b>

20:13.980 --> 20:16.360
<b><i>My magic was countered?</i></b>

20:16.480 --> 20:18.730
<b>Spider counter maxed!</b>

20:19.780 --> 20:21.740
<b>However did you find me out?</b>

20:22.110 --> 20:25.990
<b>Guilty until proven innocent
is more expedient.</b>

20:29.700 --> 20:33.040
<b>I see. So you were fooled at first.</b>

20:33.040 --> 20:36.750
<b>I even chose the face of a student here, too.</b>

20:37.000 --> 20:38.750
<b>Innocent Zero.</b>

20:38.880 --> 20:42.260
<b>A dark magic organization
working in the shadows of society.</b>

20:42.630 --> 20:47.010
<b>What are sewer rats like you
doing in this school?</b>

20:47.510 --> 20:50.560
<b>Tell me.
If you speak nonsense, I'll kill you.</b>

20:50.770 --> 20:52.230
<b>Searching.</b>

20:52.310 --> 20:53.850
<b>Searching?</b>

20:54.020 --> 20:57.770
<b>Yes, it's something
very, very, very important to us.</b>

20:58.270 --> 21:03.280
<b>It should be in this school right now.
How strange.</b>

21:03.280 --> 21:08.780
<b>SLUMP</b>

21:04.660 --> 21:08.780
<b>We had Abel searching for it,
but he couldn't find it at all.</b>

21:09.330 --> 21:11.660
<b>He's so useless.</b>

21:11.660 --> 21:14.210
<b>That's not an answer, punk.</b>

21:14.210 --> 21:15.290
<b>You're so dumb.</b>

21:15.460 --> 21:18.790
<b>Why would I tell you?
We're not even friends.</b>

21:18.920 --> 21:24.180
<b>To get information out of someone,
you have to open their heart first.</b>

21:25.130 --> 21:28.100
<b>That's just common sense.</b>

21:29.140 --> 21:30.930
<b>Oh, no, no, no.</b>

21:31.180 --> 21:33.350
<b>I don't have time
to be doing things like this.</b>

21:33.810 --> 21:37.150
<b>I have to go kill Abel
now that we're done with him.</b>

21:37.610 --> 21:39.940
<b>Sorry. I won't be able to deal with you.</b>

21:46.910 --> 21:53.500
<b>I'll be your opponent.
The serial killer and cannibalist, Jon Pierre.</b>

21:53.700 --> 21:58.380
<b><i>This is bad. His power's on par
with a Divine Visionary's.</i></b>

21:58.580 --> 22:01.090
<b><i>They won't stand a chance against him.</i></b>

22:01.630 --> 22:04.970
<b>Hip, hip, hooray!</b>

23:35.260 --> 23:39.980
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MASH BURNEDEAD AND THE MAGIC MIRROR</b>
